@startuml sequence-sign-in
title Sign in and call a protected endpoint (REST)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
autonumber

actor User
participant "React UI" as UI
participant "AccountController" as Api
participant "IwfcFacade" as Facade
participant "AuthenticationUseCase" as Auth
participant "PasswordHasher\n(PBKDF2)" as Hasher
database "users + credentials" as Store

User -> UI : user id + password
UI -> Api : POST /api/login {userId, password}
Api -> Facade : signIn(userId, password)
Facade -> Auth : signIn(...)
Auth -> Store : find active user + credential
Auth -> Hasher : matches(password, storedHash)
alt wrong password, unknown or deactivated user
  Auth --> Api : InvalidCredentialsException\n("Invalid user id or password", the same for every case)
  Api --> UI : 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS
else success
  Auth --> Api : AuthSession(token, user, expiresAt)
  Api --> UI : 200 {token, user, expiresAt}
end

UI -> Api : GET /api/equipment\nAuthorization: Bearer <token>
Api -> Facade : authenticate(token)
Facade -> Auth : authenticate(token)
Auth --> Api : the signed-in user
Api --> UI : 200 equipment list
note over Auth
  Token expired, signed out or its user deactivated:
  401, and the UI returns to the login screen.
end note
@enduml
